### 4. **State Management & Backup**

**State File Location:**
```
S3 Bucket: hng-terraform-state-617163942982
├── prod/terraform.tfstate (current state)
├── prod/terraform.tfstate.backup (daily backup)
└── backups/ (destroy operation backups)
```

**Security:**
- ✅ Encrypted at rest (SSE-S3)
- ✅ Versioning enabled
- ✅ Access restricted to GitHub Actions role
- ✅ Regular backups before destroy operations

**Why State File Matters:**
- Terraform knows what's deployed vs what's in code
- Can calculate minimal changes (only create/update what's needed)
- Prevents "drift" (when AWS doesn't match Terraform code)
- Enables safe rollbacks to previous infrastructure versions

